/E (to build social networks from literature fiction. Characters are automatically extracted not just as string matches but as characters quoting conversation and therefore creating more semantic networks; however, it does depend on quote attribution, a difficult problem itself and one especially difficult with indirect speech or interior monologue in novels.)
/Pg 20 0 R
