482 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (Input Layer: At the input layer, the user supplies the news text to be detected. The input news text can be a.txt file, a PDF file with text-based content, or any of the built-in sample news texts.encoding detection and normalization of the input news text is done at this stage.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (The NLP Analysis Layer is the primary location for the extraction of characters. TheNLP Analysis Layer NER executes on the text in chunks, and detects PERSONs. Aliases resolution algorithm aggregates these into canonical character identities. This layer is entirely offline.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (The canonical characters are fed into this layer and we measure how frequently they co-occur in the text. We turn these counts into a weighted graph using NetworkX.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
