713 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 193 0 R
/E (Uses Plotly 5.20+ for interactive network plot. The character network plot is made with a scatter chart with individual point locations set by the spring layout of a NetworkX graph, line width based on relationship strength, size of the character proportional to total mentions for the character, and character names as text labels.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
714 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 193 0 R
/E (The Plotly figure is shown with st.plotlychart, usecontainer_width=True to fill the whole browser window. This comes with pan & zoom controls enabled by default, which is necessary with dense networks as labels can overlap at the default zoom level.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
