/Title (In t he subtask of characterextraction, three systems were compared: a system A based on the raw, no- postprocessed output of SpaCy's NER component, a system B using NER component of Stanford core NLP and a system C based on a pipeline created by Lit Mind. All three systems were used with the same Dracula's story.)
/Dest [39 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3088 0 R
/Next 3101 0 R
>>
endobj
