/Title (Figure 3: F1-score comparison for Lit Mind achieved 93.4% F1-score for extracting character entities. It's much better than the vanilla SpaCy NER\(72.4%\) by eliminating false positives caused by honorific and new locations. On Stanford CoreNLP\(81.0%\), it outperforms vanilla SpaCy on character detection but not satisfactory due to alias resolving issues on literay text.)
