/Title (The four sub-processes for the highest level 1 lit Mind process are: Level 1 lit Mind process with sub-processes input Process 1.0 \(Text Ingestion\) input a file and output a text string \(textclean\). Process 2.0 \(Character Extraction\) input the text string and output a list of Character Result objects \(characterresults\). Process 3.0 \(Relationship Computation\) input the Character Result list and output the list of Relation objects with the relation name, the number of co-occurrences, and the range of Gemini classifications that can be a Gemini identifier \(cooccuringcounts\). Process 4.0 \(Visualization & Output\) input the list of Relation objects and output the Plotly figure, Pandas Data Frames for the tables, and markdown summary text \(viz_output\).)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3193 0 R
/Next 3205 0 R
>>
