/Title (At the most abstracted level, Lit Mind interact with two external domain: the User and the Google Gemini API. The User interact with Lit Mind through a request to analyze an uploaded novelty file and an optional API key that is used to fetch the analysis results. The Gemini API interact with the prompt as structured text and the response as structured JSON. { { { The core process of Lit Mind is to convert the raw text into the analysis outputs.)
